{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/8348","id":2536313851,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAacf886XLRP7","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348","diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348","number":8348,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"xdsclient: fix unexpectedly large LoadReportInterval in initial load report request","user":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Internal bug: b/416260484\r\n\r\nThe `lastReportedAt` field is uninitialized during reporter construction, defaulting to the `Zero` timestamp. This results in an excessively large `LoadReportInterval` (calculated as Now() - lastReportedAt) for the initial load report. Initializing `lastReportedAt` to Now() during construction will ensure the `LoadReportInterval` is accurately approximated for the first report.\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES:\r\n- xdsclient: fix unexpectedly large LoadReportInterval in initial load report request.","creat